{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月15日 12:26 星期日</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>黃大仙下邨龍光樓今早（15日）約8時半發生火警，消防員在起火單位內發現一具屍體，死者身分及起火原因有待調查。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>消防接報到場後疏散約50名居民，約半小時後將火救熄。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕火警 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:55:48.223341+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:26:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T05:09:32.568518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T04:49:17.737360+00:00","content_hash":"219a8b28324fc1b85f300b1689bbef3f48dd2a39ff7934c48d1aa04e5117dbc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}